  unitName: Valkyrie
  unitId: 50082
  unitNumber: 119
  description: A warrior of light who traverses battlefield after battlefield on
    a mission from the gods. They're a different species from humans despite their
    human-with-wings appearance. As there are only females, they are still being
    studied to see how they maintain their species. Legend has is that the gods left
    them to defend the world. They have a sword to protect the world from evil.
  summonDesc: I've waited so very<br>long for this moment.<br>I devote myself to
    you.
  fusionDesc: I can feel the light.<br>I will use my blade to <br>share this with
    the world.
